"P2757541190" "You're not above some good old-fashioned piracy, are ye? Har har! I thought not! I've gotten word the Family is bringing in a sizable arms shipment. This is a prime target, and I know some interested parties who would like to to acquire said weapons. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Intercept the cargo ship and steal the arms shipment.</A><br><br>You have 60 minutes to complete this mission."
