"P1560613637" "This simple gold ring feels cold and heavy in your hands, and you hear malevolent whispers in your mind. You need to destroy it in the Hellforge!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3154595845" "I have a small trinket that I need ya to get rid of for some mystic types. It's some sort of magic ring, but it's got curse upon it and needs to be destroyed. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take the ring to the Hell Forge and throw it in a barrel of industrial-strength acid.</A><br><br>Yarrr, I'll be glad to be rid of the cursed thing. Gives me the heebie-jeebies! Plus those damn Arachnos troops keep huntin' for it!"
// AcceptString :
"P3969965735" "Destroy magic ring in Hell Forge"
// SendOffString :
"P884730895" "I've got a truck at the docks you can take to the Hell Forge. Wait until the workers leave the Hell Forge, then head over to one of the smelting pots and get rid of that ring!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2595134241" "What are ya waitin' for? Get rid of that cursed ring!"

