// DetailString :
"P2180669582" "This is a valuable family heirloom taken from one of the graves in Potter's Field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1338646048" "Are ya squeamish about the dead there {VillainName}? Har har...<br><br>I found out one of the miners who is buried in Potter's Field a while back took something with him that was very valuable, a family heirloom worth a small fortune! I sent some of me boys there to tunnel underneath and find it, but they were scared off by the supernatural nastiness of the place. I need someone who ain't afraid of no ghost! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Potter's Field and find the hidden booty amongst the graves.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2093385837" "Find family heirloom"
// SendOffString :
"P3818083495" "You should be able to find the most recent graves - they're the ones with the freshest dirt!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1129937403" "Have you retrieved the heirloom from the graveyard yet? Get goin'!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P499583615" "A cold wind moans through these tunnels beneath the graveyard. At least you hope it was the wind..."

